Hippoo helps you manage WooCommerce orders, inventory, and analytics from your mobile. Get real-time notifications and control your store on the go.

== Short Description ==
Manage your WooCommerce store on the go with Hippoo. Get real-time order notifications, manage inventory, and track sales—all from your mobile device.

== Description ==
<h3><b>Hippoo WooCommerce App | Your Store, Anywhere, Anytime</b></h3>
<span style="font-weight: 400;">The <strong><a href="https://hippoo.app">Hippoo WooCommerce app</a> </strong> is a powerful extension that enhances the functionality of your WooCommerce shop. Seamlessly integrate your shop with the Hippoo Android app to unlock advanced features, including the creation of out-of-stock lists, adding images to order products via API, and user authentication for optimal app utilization. Take control of your shop's inventory, order fulfillment, and customer engagement with ease.</span>
<h3><b>Key Features:</b></h3>
<ol>
  <li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Advanced Sales Analytics: Track revenue, top-selling products, and trends with a custom date range for deeper insights.</span></li>
  <li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Extensive Add-ons & Integrations: Enhance functionality with powerful add-ons and third-party integrations.</span></li>
  <li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Create & Edit Orders/Products: Customize orders and products with advanced options, including pricing, variations, and attributes.</span></li>
  <li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">WordPress Media Gallery Access: Upload, delete, and share media directly from your WooCommerce store.</span></li>
  <li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Team Collaboration & Order Sharing: Share or duplicate orders easily with your team to improve efficiency.</span></li>
  <li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Out-of-Stock List: Monitor low-stock and out-of-stock products to restock efficiently and prevent missed sales.</span></li>
  <li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Order Product Image API: Enhance order management with product images for better fulfillment and customer satisfaction.</span></li>
  <li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">User Authentication: Securely authenticate users for advanced store management features.</span></li>
  <li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Invoice & Shipping Label Creation: Generate and customize invoices and shipping labels with automatic order details.</span></li>
  <li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Barcode Generation: Display and print barcodes for product SKUs and order IDs. Quickly find orders and products by scanning barcodes.</span></li>
  <li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Instant Order Notifications: Get notified the moment you receive a new order or when a product goes out of stock.</span></li>
  <li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Multi-Shop Management: Add and manage multiple WooCommerce stores for free—all in one app!</span></li>
  <li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Hundreds More Features: Enjoy a comprehensive toolset with exclusive WooCommerce management features you won’t find in other apps!</span></li>
</ol>

<h3><b>To install the Hippoo WooCommerce app on your phone:</b></h3>
<ol>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Visit the Google Play Store using the following link:</span><a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=io.hippo"> <span style="font-weight: 400;">Hippoo Android App</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Click on the "Install" button to download and install the Hippoo app on your Android device.</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Open the Hippoo app and follow the on-screen instructions to authenticate your shop and start utilizing the advanced features.</span></li>
</ol>

== Installation ==

1. Upload the plugin folder to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress
3. Install <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=io.hippo">Hippo WooCommerce app (Android)</a> or <a href="https://apps.apple.com/ee/app/hippoo-woocommerce-admin-app/id1667265325">Hippoo WooCommerce app for iOS</a>

